<td id="S3.T1.4.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b">Estate Planning &amp; Legacy</td>
<td id="S3.T1.4.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b">
<span id="S3.T1.4.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.4.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Wills, trusts, inheritance considerations, and minimising estate taxes (accounting for regional variations).</span>
</span></td>
