            <span id="lstnumberx34.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">**Responses</span><span id="lstnumberx34.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx34.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx34.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">␣</span><span id="lstnumberx34.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Rank:**</span>
</div>
